        "excerpt": "  // LUNAR PARASELENAE / moondogs: the lunar analogue of sundogs — lateral spots at the moon's elevation, RARE,\n  // needing a bright moon + thin ice cloud (cirrus). Lateral only when plausible.\n  let moonParhelia=cirrus*moonLume*clamp((14-moonSky.alt)/16);\n  if(DEBUGOPTIC===\"halo\")sunHalo=0.95; else if(DEBUGOPTIC===\"sundogs\")sunDogs=0.95; else if(DEBUGOPTIC===\"pillar\")sunPillar=0.9; else if(DEBUGOPTIC===\"anticrep\")antiCrep=0.8; else if(DEBUGOPTIC===\"paraselene\")moonParhelia=moonLightEligible?0.9:0; else if(DEBUGOPTIC===\"lunarhalo\")lunarHalo=moonLightEligible?0.95:0;\n"
